{
  "id": 1675,
  "name": "scroll-of-darkness",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "gameplay",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/21/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なかけじく。あくの極意が　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "어느 특정 포켓몬을 진화시키는 이상한 족자. 악의 오의가 적혀 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "可以讓特定的寶可夢進化的神奇掛軸。其中記載著惡之精髓。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un rouleau mystérieux pouvant faire évoluer un certain Pokémon. Tous les secrets de la voie des Ténèbres y sont inscrits.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese sonderbare Schriftrolle löst bei einem bestimmten Pokémon die Entwicklung aus. Auf ihr stehen die verborgenen Geheimnisse der Künste des Unlichts.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curioso manuscrito que hace evolucionar a una determinada especie de Pokémon. En él se revelan los secretos del tipo Siniestro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Rotolo particolare che fa evolvere determinate specie di Pokémon. Vi sono scritti i segreti più nascosti della dottrina del Buio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A peculiar scroll that can make a certain species of Pokémon evolve. Written upon it are the true secrets of the path of darkness.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ある特定の　ポケモンを進化させる　不思議なかけじく。あくの極意が　書かれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "能让某些特定宝可梦进化的神奇挂轴。上面写着恶之奥秘。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Curioso manuscrito que hace evolucionar a una determinada especie de Pokémon. En él se revelan los secretos del tipo Siniestro.",
